      "short": "$2,3,5,8.5,12$. Correct answer: A.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Maximum}&=2+10=12\\end{align*}$$\nThe ordered data are $2,3,3,3,5,5,8,9,12$. Exclude the median 5 when dividing the data into halves.\n$$\\begin{align*}Q_1&=\\frac{3+3}{2}=3\\\\Q_2&=5\\\\Q_3&=\\frac{8+9}{2}=8.5\\end{align*}$$\nThe five-number summary is $2,3,5,8.5,12$. Correct answer: A.",
